%% M6 socket handshake and room authorisation. Editable source for 05-seq-socket-handshake-rooms.svg / .png.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer browser
    participant BFF as Next.js BFF
    participant SG as Socket.IO gateway
    participant TR as tracking-service REST
    participant TS as Socket ticket store (Redis)
    participant RP as RoomPolicy
    U->>BFF: POST /api/bff/api/v1/tracking/socket-tickets with session cookie
    BFF->>BFF: attach access token server-side, token never sent to browser
    BFF->>TR: POST socket-tickets with bearer token
    TR->>TS: store ticket with 60 s TTL
    TR-->>BFF: single-use ticket, 60 s, and rooms for the principal
    BFF-->>U: ticket and rooms
    U->>SG: connect with handshake auth.ticket
    SG->>TS: consume ticket (GETDEL, one use)
    alt ticket unknown, used or expired
        TS-->>SG: none
        SG-->>U: connect_error unauthorized, disconnect
    else valid
        TS-->>SG: Principal sub, roles, merchantId
        SG-->>U: connected
        U->>SG: join user:OWN_SUB
        SG->>RP: canJoin principal, user:OWN_SUB
        RP-->>SG: allow
        SG-->>U: joined
        U->>SG: join user:OTHER_SUB
        SG->>RP: canJoin principal, user:OTHER_SUB
        RP-->>SG: deny, sub differs
        SG-->>U: error forbidden, room not joined
        U->>SG: join merchant:MERCHANT_ID (merchant claim must match)
        SG->>RP: canJoin principal, merchant:MERCHANT_ID
        RP-->>SG: deny, claim differs
        SG-->>U: error forbidden, room not joined
        U->>SG: join dispatch
        SG->>RP: canJoin principal, dispatch
        RP-->>SG: deny, role CUSTOMER
        SG-->>U: error forbidden, room not joined
    end
    Note over U,SG: Anonymous socket with no ticket or token: only public tracking rooms.
    Note over U,SG: auth.token (native apps) is verified against Keycloak JWKS.
